  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Vietnam 12.3 Campaign:  Raising Awareness towards Food Loss and Waste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to:
- Raise awareness amongst government agencies, the private sector, and citizens about the issue of food loss and waste, the benefits of addressing it, and how to do so.
- Share good practices in reducing food loss and wastes during harvesting, processing, storing and sale.</narrative>
  </description>
